      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BARSTOOL DOLLARS (1) showed little early speed at her last couple, the latest finishing fifth (23.48) in a Grade 4 at Gosford. Has a good record here including three wins. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings two times from three starts. Has winning claims on her best figures. FAITH IN CAEDEN (2) was prominent early from the tricky draw and stalked the lead before levelling up to score (19.54) at Bulli in a Grade 5 over 340m. Consistent performer from this draw with a win and two minor placings to his credit. Will go close again if runs up to latest. DOONSIDE ROBYN (8) has shown good improvement at her last two starts, most recently finishing 3rd at Bulli over 340m. Leading player again. JUST BRAXTON (5) is building a solid run of minor placings and will play a big role again.",
